# Scorecards & Popovers

## Scorecards

- Scorecards have **no eyebrow**, even when there is no status or count for the
  item (e.g. GRAS / UPF verification cards).
- Numeric values animate a count-up (see the count-up rule).

## Popovers

- Popovers anchor **above** or **to the right** of their trigger icon — never
  directly below it — matching the existing icon popovers (e.g. the appearance
  popover in the primary navigation sits above its icon).
- When a toggle expands and adds content (e.g. the jam strip toggling on in the
  primary nav), the popover must **reposition** so it stays correctly attached
  to its trigger.
- Popover text must be legible in both light and dark mode.
- Every three-dot (⋮ / ⋯) that owns a menu opens that popover **on hover**, not
  on tap. See the three-dot-hover rule. Touch and keyboard still toggle.
